        "eyebrow": "What you'll feel",
        "heading": "The drink that <em>lifts</em> after you do.",
        "subtitle": "<p>Amino acids are precursors to protein — a vital nutrient your body needs to build and repair. Drink MINOS any time of day: morning with breakfast, before, during, or after a workout, or in between meals.</p>",
