    "ingredients": {
      "type": "zeta-ingredients",
      "blocks": {
        "i1": {
          "type": "tile",
          "settings": {
            "featured": false,
            "icon": "<svg class=\"ingredient-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><path d=\"M30 6 L46 18 L46 42 L30 54 L14 42 L14 18 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#006E73\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"36\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Cormorant Garamond\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#006E73\" font-weight=\"500\">L</text></svg>",
            "tag": "",
            "corner_tag": "",
            "label": "The Master Trigger",
            "label_color": "teal",
            "name": "L-Leucine",
            "source": "1,500 mg · mTOR signal",
            "body": "<p>The amino acid that flips the switch on muscle protein synthesis. As we age, the threshold for that signal rises. MINOS dosed leucine high enough to clear that bar — robustly. Without enough leucine, the rest don't get to do their job.</p>",
            "nick": "The one that says \"go.\""
          }
        },
        "i2": {
          "type": "tile",
          "settings": {
            "featured": false,
            "icon": "<svg class=\"ingredient-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#B89968\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><circle cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#B89968\" opacity=\"0.4\"/><path d=\"M22 30 Q26 24 30 30 Q34 36 38 30\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#B89968\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg>",
            "tag": "",
            "corner_tag": "The Differentiator",
            "label": "The Smart Advantage",
            "label_color": "bronze",
            "name": "L-Arginine",
            "source": "405 mg · nitric oxide precursor",
            "body": "<p>Most EAA formulas stop at the basics. We added L-Arginine on purpose. It's a precursor to nitric oxide — meaning better blood flow, more oxygen and nutrients to working muscles. A 16-week RCT showed <strong>+1.14 kg lean body mass</strong> and <strong>+22% lower-body strength</strong> — gains beyond EAAs alone.</p>",
            "nick": "The one that turns on the lights."
          }
        },
        "i3": {
          "type": "tile",
          "settings": {
            "featured": false,
            "icon": "<svg class=\"ingredient-icon\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\"><path d=\"M12 30 Q30 14 48 30 Q30 46 12 30 Z\" fill=\"#6B7280\" opacity=\"0.25\"/><path d=\"M12 30 Q30 14 48 30 Q30 46 12 30 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6B7280\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"22\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"38\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"#6B7280\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"30\" y2=\"38\" stroke=\"#6B7280\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"/></svg>",
            "tag": "",
            "corner_tag": "",
            "label": "The Complete Profile",
            "label_color": "mid",
            "name": "All 9 EAAs",
            "source": "Lysine · Valine · Isoleucine · Threonine · Phenylalanine · Methionine · Histidine · Tryptophan + Leucine",
            "body": "<p>Your body can't make these on its own. You have to eat them — or supplement them. MINOS delivers the full essential profile in researched ratios. Most \"BCAA\" powders stop at three. We don't.</p>",
            "nick": "The full set."
          }
        }
      },
